  "slug": "hvac-installation-work-order-form",
  "title": "HVAC Installation Work Order and Completion Record",
  "subtitle": "Authorize hvac installation work, translate scope into a controlled field plan, verify safe release and technical hold points, resolve exceptions, and close the order.",
  "description": "A field-ready HVAC Installation work order covering customer and contract authority, site and crew routing, planned tasks and quantities, materials and dependencies, safe-work release, inspections and tests, changed conditions, completion evidence, customer handoff, and accountable closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use when dispatch, a project manager, the HVAC installation lead, quality reviewers, and the customer need one authorized HVAC Installation work record from assignment through verified completion without treating the work order as a safety permit.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
